      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model Links\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/gemma-4/resolve/main/text_encoders/gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n- [Other model weights](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/gemma-4/tree/main/text_encoders)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n```"
